sure you've noticed.

I changed "lo gasnu" to "a causer", because the important thing
about gasnu is that it's agentive.  I'd like to make "lo se gasnu"
into "something caused by an agent", but the edit screen won't come
up for that.

Sure is nice to have the search; too bad it's such a giant hog; I
can only make it work reliably in FF.

-Robin

